@E_Commerse.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5195

GET {{E_Commerse.Web_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Get All Products 
GET {{E_Commerse.Web_HostAddress}}/api/Products


### Get Product By Id
@id = 10
GET {{E_Commerse.Web_HostAddress}}/api/Products/{{id}}     ## Replace 10 with the desired product ID





